# meridian-browser - Web browser
Package: meridian-browser
Version: 0.1.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Meridian OS Apps Team <apps@meridian-os.org>
Description: Meridian Browser - Web browser with WebKitGTK
 Web browser with tabs, reader mode, adblock, sync,
