# flash-kernel - Kernel flash utility
Package: flash-kernel
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: required
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Meridian OS Bootloader Team <bootloader@meridian-os.org>
Description: Flash kernel to boot partition
 Utility to flash kernel, initramfs, and device tree to boot partition
 with support for OSTree and multiple device types.
Depends: u-boot-tools, mtd-utils, mtd-utils-ubifs, dtc, flash-kernel-db

# sensorfw - Sensor framework
Package: sensorfw
Version: 1.0.0
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Meridian OS Middleware Team <middleware@meridian-os.org>
Description: Sensor framework (from Harmattan)
 Sensor framework with D-Bus API, IIO backend, calibration,
 and sensor fusion (AHRS). Ported from Harmattan sensorfw.
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libglib2.0-0, libdbus-1-3, libiio0,
         libqt6core6, libqt6dbus6

# ofono - Telephony stack
Package: ofono
Version: 1.33
Section: comm
Priority: required
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Meridian OS Middleware Team <middleware@meridian-os.org>
Description: Open Source Telephony - ofono fork for Meridian
 ofono with OMAP3 HSI support for N900, USB CDC/ACM for N9,
 and QRTR/QMI for modern devices.
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libglib2.0-0, libdbus-1-3, libudev1,
         libmm-glib0, mobile-broadband-provider-info, usb-modeswitch

